{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ultimate 2D Shooter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rat with an assault rifle? How about a rat with <i>TWENTY</i> guns \u2014 including shotguns, energy weapons, grenade launchers, an overpowered harpoon gun, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/extras/gungif2.gif?t=1746065986\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Epic Spells and Perks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guns not enough? That\u2019s fair. That\u2019s why GAT RAT can also wield elemental spells and game-changing perks that completely transform your playstyle into something wild and overpowered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/extras/spellgif2.gif?t=1746065986\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immersive Pixel Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot your way through 9 vastly different realms, each packed with multiple levels, unique enemies, and intense boss fights \u2014 all rendered in beautiful pixel art, just waiting to be destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAT RAT Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 guns, each with their own feel and strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 unique spells to excel in different scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 perks to turn GAT RAT into the ultimate shooter. (Or spellcaster. Or brick wall.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect loot from slain enemies, and return to your hideout to upgrade your gear and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 vastly different realms, each with multiple levels of their own, complete with a massive variety of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique boss fights that each require their own strategy to beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful, immersive pixel art for every world and enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaderboards for fastest boss clears \u2014 build the best loadout and show everyone who the greatest is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaderboard for lifetime collected loot. YOU could be the richest and most prosperous GAT RAT in the entire world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661740?t=1746065986","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661740?t=1746065986","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/993aae5f6974396bb8d9452d2e18aba087a6aedf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746065986","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/993aae5f6974396bb8d9452d2e18aba087a6aedf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746065986","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ultimate 2D Shooter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rat with an assault rifle? How about a rat with <i>TWENTY</i> guns \u2014 including shotguns, energy weapons, grenade launchers, an overpowered harpoon gun, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/extras/gungif2.gif?t=1746065986\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Epic Spells and Perks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guns not enough? That\u2019s fair. That\u2019s why GAT RAT can also wield elemental spells and game-changing perks that completely transform your playstyle into something wild and overpowered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/extras/spellgif2.gif?t=1746065986\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immersive Pixel Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot your way through 9 vastly different realms, each packed with multiple levels, unique enemies, and intense boss fights \u2014 all rendered in beautiful pixel art, just waiting to be destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAT RAT Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 guns, each with their own feel and strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 unique spells to excel in different scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 perks to turn GAT RAT into the ultimate shooter. (Or spellcaster. Or brick wall.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect loot from slain enemies, and return to your hideout to upgrade your gear and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 vastly different realms, each with multiple levels of their own, complete with a massive variety of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique boss fights that each require their own strategy to beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful, immersive pixel art for every world and enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaderboards for fastest boss clears \u2014 build the best loadout and show everyone who the greatest is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaderboard for lifetime collected loot. YOU could be the richest and most prosperous GAT RAT in the entire world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Dark Snow Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/b4371f9d2e898683a5278214a22e6923a923566e/header.jpg?t=1746065986","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257129223,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129223/movie480.mp4?t=1745495140","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129223/movie_max.mp4?t=1745495140"},"name":"GAT RAT Gameplay Reveal","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257129223/7e7114322e9a2ca401fd186098617f65d83959a3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745495140","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129223/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745495140","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129223/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745495140"}}],"name":"GAT RAT","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 M380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Dark Snow Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"August 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/309585bf16910babd30afbeb7c6d5ec02d6d8dbd/ss_309585bf16910babd30afbeb7c6d5ec02d6d8dbd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746065986","path_thumbnail":"